@devp commented on this issue.

Root cause: the export tool on the Veritas side writes a UTF-8 BOM, so the first header reads as "﻿site_id" and the mapper falls through to the unknown-column path. Same thing would hit anyone exporting from Excel on Windows.

Fix is a one-liner in the reader (open with utf-8-sig). PR #413 is up with a fixture built from the sample file Ivan sent.

